<title>THAILAND: Bank of Ayudhya third quarter net up.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ayudhya third quarter net up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unreviewed results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 3.14	vs	     2.96</p>
<p>    Net		     1,571.6	vs	  1,183.6</p>
<p>Note: Bank of Ayudhya Ltd is a commercial bank. Nine month figures not available.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950, 652-0642</p>
